    {
        "id":"mg_myrelis_illusion_why_build_that_10",
        "message":"Let me tell you a little story. Long ago, I was an indentured servant, toiling away as a miner here in Galmore. This place was a prison to my spirit, a bleak and joyless pit. When I was freed, I swore I would transform it. I wanted to create something that could transport others to a place of happiness and light, even if just for a moment. That beach is the opposite of this wretched place.",
